      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUST A BABE (2) doesn't win out of turn but recent form sound. Has been in the money the last four starts, the latest when second (19.70) at this track. Has never missed the frame at the trip from three starts. Leading chance again. LADY NOVA (1) has been in the minors the last two, the latest showing strong pace early but gathered in and finished a 2.75 lengths third over 400m Gawler in 23.35. Expecting another good run. RICO CAPPUCCINO (5) won comfortably last time scoring by 6 lengths at this track after jumping from box 4 (19.89). Has the squeeze box to overcome and will need the breaks early. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. ZIPPING NORRIS (7) has to be respected despite coming off a four months break.",
